const LMS={api:null,ok:false,find(){let w=window,d=0;while(w&&d<12){if(w.API)return w.API;if(w.parent===w)break;w=w.parent;d++;}return null;},
init(){try{this.api=this.find()||(window.opener&&window.opener.API)||null;if(this.api){this.api.LMSInitialize("");this.ok=true;}}catch(e){}},
set(k,v){if(this.ok)try{this.api.LMSSetValue(k,String(v));}catch(e){}},
commit(){if(this.ok)try{this.api.LMSCommit("");}catch(e){}},
finish(score,done){if(!this.ok)return;try{if(score!=null){this.set("cmi.core.score.raw",score);this.set("cmi.core.score.min",0);this.set("cmi.core.score.max",100);}if(done)this.set("cmi.core.lesson_status","completed");this.commit();this.api.LMSFinish("");}catch(e){}}};
window.addEventListener("beforeunload",()=>{if(LMS.ok){LMS.set("cmi.core.lesson_status",S.finished?"completed":"incomplete");LMS.commit();try{LMS.api.LMSFinish("");}catch(e){}}});
